Package: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qimsdk
Section: contrib/metapackages
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-qimsdk-oss,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-qimsdk-camsrc,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Complete collection of Qualcomm GStreamer plugins
 This metapackage installs all Qualcomm GStreamer plugins, providing
 comprehensive support for video processing, machine learning inference,
 metadata handling, messaging, and inter-process communication. Designed
 for Qualcomm platforms, these plugins enable efficient multimedia pipelines
 with hardware acceleration and AI capabilities. It pulls in the open-source
 plugin collection (gstreamer1.0-plugins-qimsdk-oss) together with the plugins
 that depend on Qualcomm proprietary components (such as the camsrc camera
 source).

