 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: GStreamer plugin for video-to-tensor conversion for ML inference
 Provides the qtimlvconverter element for converting video frames into tensor
 format suitable for machine learning model input. Supports various
 preprocessing operations including scaling, cropping, color space conversion,
 normalization, and ROI extraction for efficient batch processing.

