Package: gstreamer1.0-plugins-qimsdk-vcomposer
Section: contrib/libs
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: GStreamer plugin for video composition and layout
 Provides the qtivcomposer element for compositing multiple video streams into
 a single output with configurable layouts. Supports picture-in-picture, split
 screen, grid layouts, and custom positioning with alpha blending and scaling
 for multi-view applications and video walls.

