Description: Python examples for Qualcomm GStreamer plugins (OSS deps only)
 Provides the subset of Python-based example applications and scripts that
 depend solely on open-source components, demonstrating usage of Qualcomm
 GStreamer plugins through Python bindings. Includes examples for ML inference,
 video processing, metadata handling, and pipeline construction using PyGObject
 and OpenCV integration. Camera examples in this package fall back to
 libcamerasrc, so they run without Qualcomm proprietary plugins.

