Package: libqimsdk-app-builder1
Section: contrib/libs
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Qualcomm IM SDK C++ application builder library
 Provides the qimsdk C++ application builder shared library, a high-level
 API for constructing GStreamer-based multimedia and ML pipelines on
 Qualcomm platforms. Wraps the underlying QIM SDK GStreamer plugins with
 convenient element, buffer, pipeline, and stream-filter abstractions for
 camera capture, video processing, and machine learning inference.

Package: libqimsdk-app-builder-dev
Section: contrib/libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 libqimsdk-app-builder1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Development files for the Qualcomm IM SDK C++ application builder
 Provides headers and the development symlink for building C++ applications
 against the qimsdk application builder library. Includes the public API for
 elements, buffers, pipelines, ML converters, post-processing, and the
 camera/appsrc/appsink source and sink helpers.

Package: qimsdk-examples
Section: contrib/utils
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 libqimsdk-app-builder1 (= ${binary:Version}),
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-qimsdk,
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: C++ reference and demo applications for the Qualcomm IM SDK
 Provides a collection of C++ reference and demo applications built with the
 qimsdk application builder library. Demonstrates camera capture, encoding,
 ML inference (detection, classification, pose, segmentation, super-resolution),
 pre/post-processing, and composition/overlay pipelines on Qualcomm platforms.

Package: python3-qimsdk
