 ${python3:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Python bindings and helpers for the Qualcomm IM SDK
 Provides the qimsdk Python package, a high-level PyGObject-based API for
 constructing GStreamer multimedia and ML pipelines on Qualcomm platforms.
 Includes element, buffer, pipeline, and stream-filter abstractions along with
 ML converter, post-process, and inference-bin helpers mirroring the C++ SDK.

