Package: qimsdk-appbuilder-configs
Section: contrib/utils
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: App-builder pipeline configurations for the Qualcomm IM SDK
 Provides YAML pipeline configuration files consumed by the qimsdk app-builder
 tooling. These declarative configs describe reference pipelines (camera,
 gesture recognition, PPE detection, YOLOv8, RTSP and USB camera) that can be
 instantiated without writing application code.
